-12-16T18:40:53Z","closed_at":"2020-12-16T00:54:03Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"This issue was triggered as a side-effect of  D9577 (https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/commit/bd9f7aa511ff1affa34bf0b57e460678c146f2e1).\r\n\r\nAfter the write is paused, the empty update consensus request is created for the peer.\r\n\r\nThis request is not sent.\r\n\r\nBut the consensus queue is not notified about it and left in the wrong state like we did not receive a response for this request.\r\nSo when it creates a new update consensus request for this peer, it would think that we were not able to send even an empty set of operations and will try to create another empty update consensus request.\r\n\r\nBecause of another bug preceding op id will be set to the wrong value causing this request to be rejected.\r\nSo we will have 2 extra update consensus requests in case of a short write pause.\r\n\r\nThe issue could be identified by \"Got LMP mismatch error from peer:\" message spam in logs.\r\n\r\nFor the user side, it could decrease performance a bit.\r\n\r\nSymptoms:\r\n\r\n```\r\nI1210 04:45:43.827607  1111 consensus_queue.cc:1139] T 248845da0049409c983652750c1fe204 P d01a404f972d49f7956ad1246bcf4029 [LEADER]: Got LMP mismatch error from peer: { peer: 9f1d19dc1f3e44bb8dfff3d728192c1c is_new: 0 last_received: 9.25048668 next_index: 25048669 last_known_committed_idx: 25048666 is_last_exchange_successful: 0 needs_remote_bootstrap: 0 member_type: VOTER num_sst_files: 5 last_applied: 9.25048666 }\r\nI1210 04:45:43.833618 32522 raft_consensus.cc:1566] T fad80ec97747495f96b4ee7632ee8d2b P d01a404f972d49f7956ad1246bcf4029 [term 2 FOLLOWER]: Refusing update from remote peer 9f1d19dc1f3e44bb8dfff3d728192c1c: Log matching property violated. Preceding OpId in replica: 2.25054230. Preceding OpId from leader: 2.25054231. (index mismatch)\r\n```\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"bmatican","id":395011,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NTAxMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/395011?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmatican","html_url":"https://github.com/bmatican","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmatican/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmatican/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmatican/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmatican/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmatican/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmatican/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmatican/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmatican/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmatican/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/6635/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/6635/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}